WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 23=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(The Great Clans' Tactics)

00:44.120 --> 00:44.919
Cheng Chuchi.

00:45.200 --> 00:46.150
I am here, Your Majesty.

00:46.160 --> 00:48.080
Go and notify Wei Hao personally.

00:48.080 --> 00:49.220
First thing tomorrow morning,

00:49.230 --> 00:51.160
he should prepare to head to
the Ministry of Justice Prison.

00:51.160 --> 00:52.300
Tell him to bring his things.

00:53.000 --> 00:53.640
(Well...)

00:53.640 --> 00:56.080
(Are we notifying him in advance
that he's going to prison?)

00:56.519 --> 00:57.599
Remember to tell him

00:58.240 --> 01:00.160
that just bringing
a change of clothes will do.

01:00.440 --> 01:02.120
He doesn't need to bring too much,

01:02.320 --> 01:04.239
but he must bring his books.

01:04.960 --> 01:07.160
He shouldn't just
play cards in there all day.

01:07.600 --> 01:08.839
He needs to read.

01:08.879 --> 01:10.320
If he remains so uneducated,

01:10.320 --> 01:10.920
how can he

01:11.079 --> 01:12.640
serve the Imperial Court in the future?

01:13.399 --> 01:14.160
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:14.559 --> 01:16.079
I shall head there now.

01:16.079 --> 01:16.799
No need.

01:17.280 --> 01:18.640
Go after you finish your shift.

01:19.280 --> 01:21.640
Just make sure no one else finds out.

01:22.079 --> 01:22.719
Understood.

01:25.840 --> 01:26.840
You heard it.

01:27.359 --> 01:29.200
The explosion outside today...

01:29.799 --> 01:32.600
Probably everyone in the capital
already knows about it.

01:33.399 --> 01:36.479
Ning'an was so moved back in the palace
that she was in tears.

01:37.200 --> 01:38.240
This young man

01:38.679 --> 01:41.399
really would do anything for Ning'an.

01:42.020 --> 01:44.990
He even dared to blow up the main gates
of the great clans' representatives.

01:46.640 --> 01:47.519
Well blasted.

01:48.200 --> 01:50.640
We must take
their arrogance down a notch.

01:51.239 --> 01:52.200
Just look.

01:52.879 --> 01:55.280
How many merchants
are left in the Great Yong?

01:55.280 --> 01:57.439
The great clans have
hoarded so much wealth.

02:01.000 --> 02:01.799
Your Majesty,

02:02.020 --> 02:02.920
regarding this matter,

02:03.159 --> 02:05.000
will Hao face punishment?

02:06.000 --> 02:07.200
If it's a civilian matter

02:08.120 --> 02:09.799
brought into the Imperial Court,

02:10.359 --> 02:10.959
I

02:11.439 --> 02:12.519
could deal with it,

02:12.719 --> 02:14.040
or I could choose not to.

02:14.040 --> 02:14.760
However,

02:15.640 --> 02:18.599
Wei Hao needs to stay
in prison for a few days.

02:19.760 --> 02:22.640
We also need to
appease the great clans for a bit.

02:24.000 --> 02:26.400
But if they expect severe punishment,

02:27.400 --> 02:29.079
then they are dreaming.

02:30.200 --> 02:32.079
The imperial decree
was just issued yesterday,

02:32.100 --> 02:33.940
and they have already
started causing trouble.

02:34.560 --> 02:36.200
Are they bullying Wei Hao,

02:36.200 --> 02:37.519
or are they bullying me?

02:37.520 --> 02:40.060
They even have the nerve
to place their petitions for impeachment

02:40.070 --> 02:41.599
right here on my desk?

02:47.387 --> 02:48.959
(Wei Mansion)

02:48.959 --> 02:49.760
Ouch, it hurts!

02:50.079 --> 02:50.799
Aunt,

02:50.799 --> 02:52.080
let's talk this through nicely.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.599
Why did you blow up their main gates?

02:53.599 --> 02:54.800
You want to scare me to death?

02:54.919 --> 02:57.080
Didn't I tell you
how powerful those great clans are?

02:57.080 --> 02:58.159
You never learn.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.680
So what if I blew it up?

02:59.879 --> 03:02.080
If I didn't, would I just let them
divorce my sisters,

03:02.080 --> 03:03.319
aunts, and all women?

03:03.719 --> 03:04.719
And now?

03:05.080 --> 03:06.520
They'll want a divorce even more now.

03:06.520 --> 03:08.190
And you've given them
the perfect excuse.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.840
You're more of a hindrance than a help.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.080
I'm not talking to you.

03:13.319 --> 03:15.199
The problem is you
don't trust me at all.

03:19.100 --> 03:21.039
If their clan leaders
hadn't sent servants over

03:21.039 --> 03:22.439
asking for ten guan
to fix their main gates,

03:22.439 --> 03:23.990
I wouldn't even have known about this.

03:25.439 --> 03:26.560
Wasn't it a hundred guan?

03:28.039 --> 03:29.400
They actually only asked for ten?

03:30.260 --> 03:32.199
Since when did the clan leaders
become so kind?

03:33.360 --> 03:34.159
You...

03:37.560 --> 03:39.080
You've made such a huge mistake.

03:39.090 --> 03:40.930
What did the Emperor
and Empress have to say?

03:42.159 --> 03:43.639
They had Cheng Chuchi tell me.

03:43.639 --> 03:45.830
They said if I cooperate and spend
a few days in prison, it'll be fine.

03:45.960 --> 03:47.479
Aunt, help me prepare the things

03:47.479 --> 03:48.780
I'll need for my stay in prison.

03:49.120 --> 03:49.680
I'm tired.

03:49.680 --> 03:50.680
I'm going to sleep now.

03:54.960 --> 03:55.759
What's this?

03:57.337 --> 03:58.818
Back in prison again?

03:58.960 --> 03:59.960
Marquis Wei,

04:00.280 --> 04:01.520
am I seeing things?

04:01.840 --> 04:03.400
You were just released a few days ago.

04:03.719 --> 04:04.800
How are you back so soon?

04:06.080 --> 04:07.240
Give me my usual room.

04:07.240 --> 04:07.719
Let's go.

04:07.879 --> 04:08.479
Wait,

04:08.479 --> 04:09.199
Marquis.

04:09.439 --> 04:11.560
What was it for this time?

04:13.319 --> 04:14.280
You don't even know?

04:14.500 --> 04:16.280
Didn't you hear
those explosions yesterday?

04:16.280 --> 04:17.039
I did.

04:17.039 --> 04:18.039
Well, that...

04:18.680 --> 04:19.840
That was my doing.

04:21.479 --> 04:22.479
Wait, Marquis, this...

04:22.479 --> 04:23.479
Who is he?

04:23.480 --> 04:24.840
Why is he getting such good treatment?

04:24.840 --> 04:26.560
He's in and out
of the Ministry of Justice Prison

04:26.560 --> 04:28.000
five times a year.

04:28.000 --> 04:29.750
Comparing myself to him
is just depressing.

04:32.039 --> 04:33.390
Is it certain he's been locked up?

04:33.479 --> 04:34.280
Confirmed.

04:34.479 --> 04:36.919
Many saw the Ministry of Justice
take Wei Hao away.

04:40.879 --> 04:42.280
He's finally in.

04:42.280 --> 04:44.120
No matter how
comfortable he makes himself,

04:44.120 --> 04:45.639
it's still the Ministry of Justice Prison.

04:45.639 --> 04:46.280
It seems

04:46.280 --> 04:47.479
our impeachment memorials

04:47.479 --> 04:48.919
actually worked.

04:49.000 --> 04:50.479
Let's see how arrogant

04:50.479 --> 04:52.080
he can be now.

04:52.479 --> 04:55.000
How dare he demand
our clan leaders come see him!

04:55.000 --> 04:56.680
Who does he think he is?

04:56.919 --> 04:57.719
Good.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.680
Locking him up is a start.

05:00.160 --> 05:02.879
Have our officials
continue to impeach him.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.519
This time, no matter what,

05:05.319 --> 05:07.040
we must strip him of his title.

05:08.079 --> 05:10.360
If his title of Marquis is revoked,

05:11.759 --> 05:14.120
I'd like to see how he
expects to marry the Eldest Princess.

05:14.959 --> 05:16.560
He's far too arrogant.

05:16.879 --> 05:19.079
We have to redecorate the main hall.

05:19.079 --> 05:20.959
Think of the time
and money that it will cost.

05:21.199 --> 05:22.360
More importantly,

05:22.560 --> 05:23.360
this time,

05:23.560 --> 05:25.920
our great clans' reputation
has been ruined.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.360
I wonder how many people

05:27.360 --> 05:29.000
are out there laughing at us.

05:33.600 --> 05:35.399
About the recent events in the capital,

05:35.639 --> 05:37.319
have you all notified your clan leaders?

05:37.639 --> 05:38.639
Of course.

05:38.959 --> 05:41.079
Wei Hao said that
if they don't come to the capital

05:41.079 --> 05:42.639
to see him within ten days,

05:42.639 --> 05:44.759
he'll print 100,000 books every month.

05:45.160 --> 05:47.240
I wouldn't dare keep that quiet.

05:47.480 --> 05:48.319
Who knows

05:48.800 --> 05:50.560
if he's actually serious?

05:52.137 --> 05:54.112
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

05:57.879 --> 05:59.040
You dead fool!

05:59.560 --> 06:01.800
Why did you blow up their main gates?

06:01.920 --> 06:03.519
You should have just ignored them.

06:03.560 --> 06:05.879
Our marriage is none of their business.

06:08.639 --> 06:09.800
I couldn't do that.

06:10.199 --> 06:10.959
They're gossiping

06:10.959 --> 06:11.959
about our marriage.

06:11.959 --> 06:12.920
They're full of it.

06:13.399 --> 06:14.199
Don't worry.

06:14.360 --> 06:15.160
With me here,

06:15.160 --> 06:15.879
it's fine.

06:16.680 --> 06:17.639
Don't you worry.

06:17.879 --> 06:18.920
In a couple of days,

06:19.279 --> 06:20.959
I'll have Father let you out.

06:21.959 --> 06:22.759
It's fine.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.079
My father-in-law said

06:24.160 --> 06:25.199
it's only for a few days.

06:25.879 --> 06:26.879
That's good then.

06:27.560 --> 06:29.439
If Father won't release you,

06:29.959 --> 06:31.360
I'll go talk to Mother.

06:32.079 --> 06:33.639
I'll have her set things right for you.

06:35.360 --> 06:36.720
My mother-in-law is the best to me.

06:38.560 --> 06:39.600
For the next few days,

06:39.600 --> 06:40.800
just stay inside.

06:42.040 --> 06:42.839
Don't worry.

06:42.959 --> 06:44.240
They won't be acting up for long.

06:44.959 --> 06:45.959
Since they've crossed me,

06:46.040 --> 06:47.680
they've finally met their match.

06:48.900 --> 06:50.439
They might have bullied others before,

06:50.439 --> 06:51.839
but they wouldn't dare touch me.

06:51.860 --> 06:53.490
When I said I'd blow up
their main gates,

06:53.500 --> 06:54.360
I blew up their gates.

06:54.399 --> 06:56.040
I even took out their living room.

06:57.079 --> 06:57.879
It's fine.

06:58.480 --> 06:59.720
You don't need to worry about me

07:01.000 --> 07:02.959
or about our wedding.

07:06.399 --> 07:08.759
I still have a trump card up my sleeve.

07:08.860 --> 07:10.720
If they really try to
force me to call it off,

07:11.079 --> 07:13.959
I'll have them begging
for mercy in no time.

07:18.787 --> 07:21.040
(Ganlu Palace)

07:21.040 --> 07:22.240
Your Majesty,

07:22.399 --> 07:24.959
Wei Hao used gunpowder
from the Ministry of Works

07:24.959 --> 07:26.480
to blow up the gates of the great clans.

07:26.480 --> 07:28.120
This matter must be severely punished.

07:28.120 --> 07:28.759
Indeed.

07:28.759 --> 07:29.439
Moreover,

07:29.439 --> 07:31.399
gunpowder is a strictly
controlled substance.

07:31.439 --> 07:33.240
How did Wei Hao get his hands on it?

07:35.639 --> 07:36.560
Get me some gunpowder.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.879
Who offended you now?

07:37.879 --> 07:40.160
Just go and prepare it quickly.

07:40.400 --> 07:42.240
When the time comes,
you must not tell anyone

07:42.240 --> 07:43.710
that I gave you the finished product.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.079
Has no one told you

07:48.080 --> 07:50.120
that Wei Hao was the one
who created this gunpowder?

07:50.130 --> 07:51.920
The formulas currently
used by the Ministry of Works

07:51.920 --> 07:52.920
were all provided by him.

07:52.920 --> 07:54.240
Since Wei Hao created it,

07:54.240 --> 07:55.439
why is any of this surprising?

07:56.160 --> 07:57.079
Besides,

07:57.079 --> 07:58.839
why are you all making such a fuss?

07:58.839 --> 08:00.519
This is just a common brawl,

08:00.520 --> 08:01.879
and you brought it
into the Imperial Court.

08:01.879 --> 08:02.959
Is this appropriate?

08:05.040 --> 08:05.839
What?

08:06.199 --> 08:07.240
Is the Imperial Court

08:07.639 --> 08:09.480
run by the great clans now?

08:09.879 --> 08:12.079
The great clans have a fight,
and it gets brought here?

08:12.360 --> 08:15.240
This is a place for discussing
the great affairs of the world!

08:15.759 --> 08:17.399
I urge Your Majesty

08:17.399 --> 08:18.920
to ignore this matter.

08:18.959 --> 08:19.759
This

08:19.759 --> 08:22.480
is not something
that should be discussed here.

08:23.720 --> 08:24.720
My dear ministers,

08:25.319 --> 08:26.639
I wish to know.

08:27.360 --> 08:29.560
If these two were common citizens

08:29.959 --> 08:31.480
who got into a fight,

08:31.480 --> 08:32.920
blew up each other's gates,

08:32.920 --> 08:34.040
and destroyed their halls,

08:34.190 --> 08:35.600
would it have reached this court?

08:35.800 --> 08:37.759
If it isn't brought before this court,

08:37.800 --> 08:39.759
where should they go for justice?

08:39.959 --> 08:42.519
Are they supposed to go
to the Capital Magistrate?

08:43.319 --> 08:45.959
The Capital Magistrate
has no authority over Wei Hao.

08:46.199 --> 08:47.600
Wei Hao is a Marquis.

08:47.920 --> 08:48.720
Furthermore,

08:48.800 --> 08:50.879
I have heard of Wei Hao.

08:50.879 --> 08:52.000
The man is fond of brawling.

08:52.000 --> 08:54.600
He's made quite a name
for himself in West City.

08:55.079 --> 08:56.439
And as far as I know,

08:56.480 --> 08:57.839
he is a habitual offender.

08:58.160 --> 09:00.079
He is unfit to be
a Marquis of the Great Yong.

09:02.079 --> 09:02.879
Your Majesty,

09:03.079 --> 09:04.199
you cannot

09:04.199 --> 09:05.839
shield Wei Hao like this

09:05.920 --> 09:07.480
just because he
is your future son-in-law.

09:07.480 --> 09:08.279
Your Majesty,

09:08.279 --> 09:10.240
Wei Hao and the Eldest Princess
are not yet married.

09:10.240 --> 09:13.079
I believe we should not push
the Eldest Princess into a pit of fire.

09:13.079 --> 09:14.360
- Indeed.
- Yes.

09:14.360 --> 09:15.559
- Your Majesty.
- It's true.

09:16.039 --> 09:19.039
Please issue a decree to
strip Wei Hao of his title.

09:20.000 --> 09:22.970
- We beg Your Majesty to issue the decree.
- We beg Your Majesty to issue the decree.

09:23.399 --> 09:24.200
Everyone,

09:24.799 --> 09:26.679
would you allow me to say a few words?

09:27.279 --> 09:29.639
Wei Hao was in the wrong,
and there is no disputing that.

09:30.000 --> 09:32.639
He should apologize
and make amends as required.

09:33.639 --> 09:34.919
But you say

09:35.039 --> 09:36.879
his title should be stripped...

09:37.159 --> 09:37.960
To that,

09:38.480 --> 09:39.720
I cannot agree.

09:40.080 --> 09:40.879
First of all,

09:41.000 --> 09:42.159
Wei Hao's rank of Lord

09:42.440 --> 09:44.759
was earned by
assisting the Eldest Princess.

09:45.320 --> 09:48.039
His contribution to the Great Yong
goes without saying.

09:48.519 --> 09:49.440
As for being a Marquis,

09:49.840 --> 09:52.279
that was earned by refining fine salt.

09:52.720 --> 09:55.679
You have surely all bought
this salt for your own homes.

09:56.159 --> 09:57.120
The key is the volume.

09:57.639 --> 09:58.960
Even commoners can afford it now.

09:59.639 --> 10:00.879
Should such merits

10:01.159 --> 10:04.120
be stripped away
just because of a conflict

10:04.120 --> 10:05.480
with those people?

10:05.879 --> 10:06.679
Everyone,

10:07.000 --> 10:08.240
if this matter

10:08.360 --> 10:09.879
reaches the common people,

10:10.240 --> 10:13.159
how will they judge it?

10:13.200 --> 10:14.919
How will they discuss this situation?

10:15.519 --> 10:17.240
Will they say the Emperor is incompetent

10:17.879 --> 10:19.519
or that the great clans are overbearing?

10:20.039 --> 10:21.559
Currently, among the commoners,

10:21.720 --> 10:24.720
the reputation of the great clans
is not exactly good.

10:25.200 --> 10:26.720
Chancellor Fang, that is uncalled for.

10:26.879 --> 10:28.799
We suggest stripping
Wei Hao of his title

10:28.799 --> 10:30.840
because his character is flawed.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.120
He is unfit to marry
the Eldest Princess,

10:32.120 --> 10:34.279
nor can he bear
the responsibilities of a Marquis.

10:34.279 --> 10:34.759
You...

10:34.960 --> 10:35.759
Your Majesty,

10:35.960 --> 10:38.240
if you cannot grant us justice,

10:38.240 --> 10:40.840
I can only resign my post
and retire to my hometown.

10:40.840 --> 10:42.360
I hope Your Majesty will grant this.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.360
Your Majesty, please see the truth

10:49.639 --> 10:51.120
and grant us justice.

10:51.480 --> 10:53.039
Wei Hao is audacious.

10:53.039 --> 10:55.480
If we do not strip him of his
marquis title today to uphold the law,

10:55.480 --> 10:56.799
others will follow suit tomorrow.

10:56.799 --> 10:58.279
Wouldn't the court fall into chaos?

10:58.279 --> 10:59.039
Your Majesty,

10:59.279 --> 11:00.720
if you still insist on shielding him,

11:00.750 --> 11:02.879
we will have no choice but to resign
and return home.

11:02.879 --> 11:05.120
We could no longer show our faces
in the Imperial Court.

11:17.759 --> 11:18.320
This...

11:38.519 --> 11:39.320
Your Majesty,

11:39.559 --> 11:41.840
these people are
really resigning this time?

11:44.919 --> 11:45.720
Your Majesty,

11:47.320 --> 11:49.320
I'm afraid this won't
be easy to resolve.

11:49.519 --> 11:52.320
The attitude of
the great clans is too firm.

11:52.320 --> 11:53.919
It's not so much about
Wei Hao hitting people,

11:53.919 --> 11:56.000
but rather demanding
that he call off the wedding.

11:56.600 --> 11:57.399
I reckon

11:57.480 --> 11:58.879
if Your Majesty uses this

11:58.879 --> 12:00.720
to make a deal with the great clans,

12:01.279 --> 12:02.320
they surely

12:02.440 --> 12:05.360
won't pursue Wei Hao for
blowing up the gate either.

12:06.519 --> 12:07.919
It's quite obvious, isn't it?

12:07.919 --> 12:08.480
Yes.

12:08.759 --> 12:09.879
And Wei Hao was also...

12:10.360 --> 12:12.799
Why did he give the great clans
such leverage against him?

12:12.799 --> 12:14.279
It's not about giving leverage.

12:14.279 --> 12:15.679
Even if Wei Hao
hadn't blown up the gate,

12:15.679 --> 12:18.120
those great clans would
have found another excuse.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.240
What are we to do?

12:20.919 --> 12:22.560
Just pushing it back and forth like this

12:22.840 --> 12:24.360
isn't a solution.

12:26.279 --> 12:27.080
Your Majesty,

12:27.440 --> 12:29.039
the great clans have united

12:29.360 --> 12:32.120
to overturn Your Majesty's
imperial decree of marriage.

12:32.399 --> 12:33.240
This matter

12:34.080 --> 12:35.200
is difficult to handle.

12:35.887 --> 12:38.328
(The difficulty lies in
the fact that current scholars)

12:38.440 --> 12:40.360
(are mostly offspring
of the great clans.)

12:40.960 --> 12:42.799
(If we wanted to
replace those officials,)

12:43.159 --> 12:44.759
(it would be very hard.)

12:44.759 --> 12:45.559
Your Majesty,

12:45.919 --> 12:48.480
if all else fails,
just withdraw the imperial decree.

12:59.039 --> 12:59.759
I

13:01.840 --> 13:03.240
will consider it further.

13:16.279 --> 13:17.159
Don't worry.

13:17.440 --> 13:19.120
Your father will find a way.

13:20.519 --> 13:22.679
His Majesty has arrived!

13:32.279 --> 13:33.679
How did the discussions go today?

13:34.000 --> 13:35.360
Is this matter behind us now?

13:39.320 --> 13:41.879
Must the great clans insist
on not letting Wei Hao go?

13:42.639 --> 13:44.639
It's not Wei Hao they won't let go of.

13:45.200 --> 13:47.120
It's me they won't let go of.

13:52.000 --> 13:52.799
Girl,

13:53.399 --> 13:55.159
I have to be honest with you.

13:56.320 --> 13:57.320
I didn't expect

13:57.600 --> 14:00.080
the great clans' attitude to
be so determined this time.

14:00.639 --> 14:02.440
Those officials from the great clans

14:02.600 --> 14:04.080
have seized upon Wei Hao

14:04.480 --> 14:05.840
and won't back down.

14:06.159 --> 14:07.279
It's very likely

14:08.679 --> 14:10.039
that I will indeed

14:10.960 --> 14:13.000
withdraw the imperial decree
for your marriage.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.519
What?

14:16.960 --> 14:17.759
Girl,

14:17.960 --> 14:19.200
your mother and I

14:19.200 --> 14:21.039
like Wei Hao very much.

14:22.039 --> 14:22.960
We also hope

14:23.120 --> 14:24.960
he can become our son-in-law.

14:25.879 --> 14:26.799
Otherwise,

14:26.879 --> 14:29.890
we wouldn't have let him keep calling
us "Father-in-law" and "Mother-in-law."

14:30.679 --> 14:32.480
But the great clans
have a prior agreement

14:32.760 --> 14:34.519
not to intermarry
with the Imperial Family.

14:35.799 --> 14:37.639
So, regarding your marriage this time,

14:38.159 --> 14:40.480
the great clans are opposed.

14:41.960 --> 14:44.440
My ministers and I

14:44.679 --> 14:46.679
have been arguing with those ministers.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.200
But it's no use.

14:49.120 --> 14:51.600
If I continue to refuse
to withdraw the imperial decree,

14:53.440 --> 14:54.600
those officials

14:55.000 --> 14:56.639
will resign en masse.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.240
At that point,

14:58.519 --> 14:59.639
we will face a situation

14:59.639 --> 15:02.039
where there's no one
left to serve the court.

15:05.279 --> 15:06.080
Father,

15:07.200 --> 15:08.759
I'm not willing to accept this.

15:09.720 --> 15:11.200
I don't know why...

15:12.120 --> 15:13.320
Before, it seemed like

15:13.879 --> 15:16.360
I didn't like
Wei the Fool all that much.

15:17.200 --> 15:18.840
But now that I know

15:19.279 --> 15:20.759
I can't marry him,

15:21.799 --> 15:22.759
I'm just...

15:24.279 --> 15:26.320
I'm just so heartbroken.

15:27.290 --> 15:28.600
It's my fault for being useless.

15:29.039 --> 15:30.159
Even as the Emperor,

15:30.559 --> 15:32.919
I can't even protect
my daughter's happiness.

15:36.360 --> 15:38.000
Wei Hao must have a way.

15:38.240 --> 15:39.799
He must have a way.

15:40.320 --> 15:43.120
Father, I need to go to
the Ministry of Justice Prison.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.519
What could he do?

15:44.559 --> 15:46.320
Wei Hao will have a solution.

15:46.919 --> 15:48.440
He told me before

15:49.080 --> 15:50.120
that no one can stop

15:50.120 --> 15:52.159
us from being together.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.960
Everything will be fine.

15:54.279 --> 15:55.200
Forget it.

15:55.240 --> 15:56.000
Don't go.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.000
It's no use.

15:57.879 --> 15:58.720
That brat

15:58.720 --> 16:00.840
can be unreliable when he speaks.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.480
Just let her go.

16:03.000 --> 16:04.159
Go and ask Wei Hao.

16:14.837 --> 16:17.667
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

16:18.287 --> 16:21.687
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

16:22.457 --> 16:25.407
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

16:25.747 --> 16:28.447
♪Sigh and walk away♪

16:30.047 --> 16:33.517
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

16:33.517 --> 16:35.747
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

16:35.747 --> 16:37.857
♪Colors and darkness♪

16:37.857 --> 16:39.877
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

16:39.877 --> 16:44.237
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

16:45.677 --> 16:49.407
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

16:49.677 --> 16:53.277
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

16:53.437 --> 16:55.517
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

16:55.517 --> 17:00.307
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

17:00.527 --> 17:02.147
♪The world mistakes me♪

17:02.147 --> 17:04.487
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

17:04.557 --> 17:05.747
♪As the storm approaches♪

17:05.747 --> 17:08.147
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

17:08.357 --> 17:10.077
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

17:10.077 --> 17:12.057
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

17:12.227 --> 17:13.977
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

17:13.977 --> 17:16.077
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

17:16.077 --> 17:17.547
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

17:17.547 --> 17:19.777
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

17:19.997 --> 17:21.197
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

17:21.197 --> 17:23.717
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

17:23.847 --> 17:25.557
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

17:25.557 --> 17:26.837
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

17:26.987 --> 17:28.407
♪My wish has finally come true♪

17:28.407 --> 17:29.447
♪To stay by your side♪

17:29.447 --> 17:31.367
♪In this fleeting world♪

17:31.537 --> 17:34.787
♪We are free and happy♪

17:38.787 --> 17:40.567
♪From a nobody♪

17:40.567 --> 17:42.467
♪To someone now famous♪

17:42.577 --> 17:44.007
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

17:44.007 --> 17:46.517
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

17:46.617 --> 17:48.197
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

17:48.197 --> 17:50.267
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

17:50.477 --> 17:52.157
♪In this vast world♪

17:52.157 --> 17:54.157
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

17:54.307 --> 17:56.517
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

17:56.517 --> 17:58.107
♪Everything ends eventually♪

17:58.197 --> 17:59.697
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

17:59.697 --> 18:02.097
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

18:02.097 --> 18:03.807
♪No matter how time flies♪

18:03.807 --> 18:04.967
♪Even if the falling snow♪

18:04.967 --> 18:06.597
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

18:06.597 --> 18:07.637
♪All I want now♪

18:07.637 --> 18:09.737
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

18:09.737 --> 18:12.997
♪Year after year♪
